      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{63c9760ef519ef0b8ce99165|full_name} I feel like the best way to implement all of this would be to allow text and icons to change based on parameter values. Add an optional parameter, then it will add a list where you can add images and assign values, or vice versa. That allows you to create whatever logic you want for them to change.",
